{"4763810": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Used Car Dealer Simulator", "steam_appid": 4763810, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Used Car Dealer Simulator</strong> is a car trading and business simulation game where you buy used cars, inspect deals, negotiate prices, sell vehicles, and grow your own car dealership from a small lot into a successful auto business.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Used Car Dealer Simulator</strong> puts you in charge of your own used car dealership. Start with a small car lot, search for profitable vehicles, buy low, sell high, and build your reputation as a smart car dealer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every car is an opportunity. Check the market, compare prices, prepare your vehicles for sale, and make the right deals to keep your business growing. From budget cars to more valuable rides, your goal is simple: turn used cars into profit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your dealership, improve your lot, attract customers, and become the go-to place for anyone looking to buy or sell a car.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Buy and sell used cars</strong> <br>Find cars at the right price, add them to your dealership, and sell them for profit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run your own car dealership</strong> <br>Manage your car lot, organize your vehicles, and grow your business step by step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Negotiate and make deals</strong> <br>Every sale matters. Choose the right price and try to get the best value from every customer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade your business</strong> <br>Expand your dealership, improve your garage, and unlock better opportunities as you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Car trading simulation</strong> <br>Experience the core loop of buying, pricing, selling, and scaling a used car business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Daylight car lot atmosphere</strong> <br>Enjoy a bright, colorful dealership environment with cars, sale signs, and a classic auto business feeling.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Used Car Dealer Simulator</strong> is a car trading and business simulation game where you buy used cars, inspect deals, negotiate prices, sell vehicles, and grow your own car dealership from a small lot into a successful auto business.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Used Car Dealer Simulator</strong> puts you in charge of your own used car dealership. Start with a small car lot, search for profitable vehicles, buy low, sell high, and build your reputation as a smart car dealer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every car is an opportunity. Check the market, compare prices, prepare your vehicles for sale, and make the right deals to keep your business growing. From budget cars to more valuable rides, your goal is simple: turn used cars into profit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your dealership, improve your lot, attract customers, and become the go-to place for anyone looking to buy or sell a car.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Buy and sell used cars</strong> <br>Find cars at the right price, add them to your dealership, and sell them for profit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run your own car dealership</strong> <br>Manage your car lot, organize your vehicles, and grow your business step by step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Negotiate and make deals</strong> <br>Every sale matters. Choose the right price and try to get the best value from every customer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade your business</strong> <br>Expand your dealership, improve your garage, and unlock better opportunities as you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Car trading simulation</strong>